+    :target: https://travis-ci.org/mcmtroffaes/pathlib2
+    :alt: travis-ci
+
+.. |appveyor| image:: https://ci.appveyor.com/api/projects/status/baddx3rpet2wyi2c?svg=true
+    :target: https://ci.appveyor.com/project/mcmtroffaes/pathlib2
+    :alt: appveyor
